<title>USA: Hearst's Ganzi seen in line for CEO post - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Hearst's Ganzi seen in line for CEO post - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hearst Corp named Victor Ganzi executive vice president, putting him in line to become the company's chief executive, the Wall Street Journal said in Monday's electronic edition.</p>
<p>Ganzi is the company's chief financial and legal officer. By the end of the year, he would assume some of the operating duties of Hearst's chief operating officer, the paper said.</p>
<p>The paper also cited people close to the company.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
